{"id":"369cd57c10ed4212","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-kunen-inconsistency.md","title":"Kunen Inconsistency","display":"thm-kunen-inconsistency — Kunen Inconsistency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kunen-inconsistency","aliases":["58-thm-kunen-inconsistency","Kunen Inconsistency","Kunen's Theorem"],"display":"thm-kunen-inconsistency — Kunen Inconsistency","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kunen-inconsistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kunen-inconsistency</span><span>Kunen Inconsistency</span><span>Kunen's Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kunen-inconsistency — Kunen Inconsistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>（集合论宇宙）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>（从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的类函数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}\">\\(\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}\\)</span>（允许量化类函数的保守类理论背景）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}\\)</span>（逐公式理解的初等嵌入模式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>（序数类）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kunen\\text{-}inconsistency}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}}\n\\neg\\exists j\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}(j,V,V)\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kunen\\text{-}inconsistency}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}}\n\\neg\\exists j\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}(j,V,V)\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“非平凡”必须由存在序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha\">\\(j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha\\)</span> 明确表达；仅写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to V\">\\(j:V\\to V\\)</span> 并不能保证初等等距性。</li>\n<li>对真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的量化在 NBG 一类的类理论中表述；“初等”按每个一阶公式的模式理解，不能由一个集合编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-真理谓词代替。</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a> 形式化集合结构之间的版本；本结论的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\to V\">\\(V\\to V\\)</span> 真类情形需要上述模式化读法。</li>\n<li>秩入秩公理研究 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\lambda\">\\(V_\\lambda\\)</span> 等真子层级上的初等嵌入，并不与本结论冲突；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span> 的标准形状是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:L(V_{\\lambda+1})\\to L(V_{\\lambda+1})\">\\(j:L(V_{\\lambda+1})\\to L(V_{\\lambda+1})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>去掉选择公理后，Reinhardt 型嵌入不由 Kunen 的原论证排除。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]] 形式化集合结构之间的版本；本结论的 $V\\to V$ 真类情形需要上述模式化读法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kunen\\text{-}inconsistency}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{NBG}+\\mathrm{GlobalChoice}}\n\\neg\\exists j\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ElementaryClassEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{sch}}(j,V,V)\\land\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j(\\alpha)\\ne\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"j:L(V_{\\lambda+1})\\to L(V_{\\l